        "TileImage": "$($repository 938c46db-742b-40e1-b4b5-9b6c08ad951e).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47!\rYour targets are four ex-special military members who took part in the murder of thousands of civilians in the Syrian War. A surviving relative of one of the families that fell victim, is now an emigrated wealthy CEO, and has hired us to take out the four men that was part of the militia that massacred his family. Three of them now work as private security for Sheik Omar Al-Ghazali, while the fourth one has put down weapons for good, and was recommended by the others as a waiter",
